DATA LICENSING NOTICE
=====================

This repository does not grant a license to the underlying ApisTox records,
toxicity measurements, or in-house descriptors. The exact CSV inputs used by
the retained campaigns are versioned here at the repository owner's direction
for auditability and reproducibility; their inclusion does not grant additional
redistribution rights.

Before redistributing data, descriptor tables, predictions linked to molecule
identifiers, or derived datasets, consult and comply with:

1. the license distributed with the specific handoff;
2. the original ApisTox dataset license and citation requirements; and
3. the terms governing any in-house descriptors.

Code is licensed separately under the MIT license in ../LICENSE.
